{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn the darkness, survival is not a choice \u2014 it\u2019s an instinct.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f84d41c4e45bdbfe9e99c7542af1ffb5.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f84d41c4e45bdbfe9e99c7542af1ffb5.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f84d41c4e45bdbfe9e99c7542af1ffb5.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a dying world consumed by darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night is a fight for survival as the infected roam freely and the horizon burns with hopelessness. With only your torch to guide you, you\u2019ll explore a massive open world filled with danger, mystery, and the remains of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the tension of <strong>true next-gen zombie survival</strong>, powered by realistic lighting, dynamic weather, and brutal AI behaviors that react to every sound and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Build. Endure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down trees, collect materials, and craft the essentials that keep you alive. Every swing of your axe echoes through the forest \u2014 and every sound can attract what lurks beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>No Way Back: Dark Horizon</strong>, resource management isn\u2019t just strategy; it\u2019s survival. One mistake, one noise, and you\u2019re done.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/4ca304f3cbb0ccbdf5a2dea42b778fc9.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/4ca304f3cbb0ccbdf5a2dea42b778fc9.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/4ca304f3cbb0ccbdf5a2dea42b778fc9.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Physics-based survival at its finest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tree falls, every structure breaks, and every sound has consequences. Build smart, move carefully, and adapt to a world that remembers every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment isn\u2019t your friend \u2014 it\u2019s alive, reactive, and merciless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ad564be178a5a4599efd6c7c345b8b60.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ad564be178a5a4599efd6c7c345b8b60.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ad564be178a5a4599efd6c7c345b8b60.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Master the art of crafting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your Craftbook and unlock hundreds of unique recipes \u2014 from primitive weapons to complex survival tools. Combine, improvise, and experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>advanced crafting system</strong> gives you full creative control to adapt your strategy to changing conditions. Innovation is the only way to outlive the apocalypse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/21a368c48ae75824b80f2ab5f18c4c80.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/21a368c48ae75824b80f2ab5f18c4c80.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/21a368c48ae75824b80f2ab5f18c4c80.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your last safe haven.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and construct your base piece by piece. Fortify walls, lay traps, and prepare for the inevitable \u2014 the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each structure has real physics, durability, and vulnerabilities. Your base isn\u2019t just a home \u2014 it\u2019s your last line of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/456f7db08731c1df9bb353a7369dc843.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/456f7db08731c1df9bb353a7369dc843.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/456f7db08731c1df9bb353a7369dc843.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every resource matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry what you can, leave what you must. The more you build, the slower you move \u2014 and the world won\u2019t wait for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time, weight, and stamina create a brutal survival balance where efficiency can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ce4f86242794d34534c28bd708c8bd4e.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ce4f86242794d34534c28bd708c8bd4e.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ce4f86242794d34534c28bd708c8bd4e.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Silence is your greatest weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your bow, steady your aim, and strike before they sense you. Long-range precision kills are key to staying undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>dynamic stealth system</strong> rewards patience and timing \u2014 one missed shot can turn silence into chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/090fba62285f83afad44b46c6a60ca01.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/090fba62285f83afad44b46c6a60ca01.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/090fba62285f83afad44b46c6a60ca01.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Close-range terror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the last arrow flies and the enemy is still standing, you fight face-to-face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>intense first-person combat</strong> with advanced enemy AI and visceral animations that make every encounter personal and deadly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f247caf4001b8eaa3e98a71a393a27bd.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f247caf4001b8eaa3e98a71a393a27bd.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f247caf4001b8eaa3e98a71a393a27bd.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Every kill tells a story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fallen corpse reminds you how close you came to death. Loot, scavenge, and learn from every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Way Back doesn\u2019t forgive \u2014 but it teaches. Adapt or perish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/30fead47affa08ea9825e873ae350a15.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/30fead47affa08ea9825e873ae350a15.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/30fead47affa08ea9825e873ae350a15.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>When hope fades, fight harder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your shotgun, steady your hands, and take the final shot that decides your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic moments of desperation define the story of <strong>No Way Back: Dark Horizon</strong> \u2014 a survival experience where every decision, every bullet, every heartbeat matters.<strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Next-Gen AI System</strong> \u2013 Enemies react to noise, light, and scent for realistic survival encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf12 <strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Visibility, temperature, and behavior change as the sun falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Deep Crafting &amp; Building</strong> \u2013 Build your shelter, craft weapons, and fortify defenses with physics-based systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Immersive First-Person Combat</strong> \u2013 From stealth takedowns to explosive boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f <strong>Massive Open World</strong> \u2013 Explore, scavenge, and uncover the secrets buried beneath the Dark Horizon.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976380?t=1759673117","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/163d18afc41300350b9733ce46815ef9090a9467/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759673117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/ebb5dfb9819fb8cac01f2f9852318547511e3f84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759673117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/ebb5dfb9819fb8cac01f2f9852318547511e3f84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759673117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn the darkness, survival is not a choice \u2014 it\u2019s an instinct.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f84d41c4e45bdbfe9e99c7542af1ffb5.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f84d41c4e45bdbfe9e99c7542af1ffb5.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f84d41c4e45bdbfe9e99c7542af1ffb5.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a dying world consumed by darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night is a fight for survival as the infected roam freely and the horizon burns with hopelessness. With only your torch to guide you, you\u2019ll explore a massive open world filled with danger, mystery, and the remains of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the tension of <strong>true next-gen zombie survival</strong>, powered by realistic lighting, dynamic weather, and brutal AI behaviors that react to every sound and movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Build. Endure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down trees, collect materials, and craft the essentials that keep you alive. Every swing of your axe echoes through the forest \u2014 and every sound can attract what lurks beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>No Way Back: Dark Horizon</strong>, resource management isn\u2019t just strategy; it\u2019s survival. One mistake, one noise, and you\u2019re done.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/4ca304f3cbb0ccbdf5a2dea42b778fc9.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/4ca304f3cbb0ccbdf5a2dea42b778fc9.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/4ca304f3cbb0ccbdf5a2dea42b778fc9.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Physics-based survival at its finest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tree falls, every structure breaks, and every sound has consequences. Build smart, move carefully, and adapt to a world that remembers every action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment isn\u2019t your friend \u2014 it\u2019s alive, reactive, and merciless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ad564be178a5a4599efd6c7c345b8b60.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ad564be178a5a4599efd6c7c345b8b60.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ad564be178a5a4599efd6c7c345b8b60.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Master the art of crafting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your Craftbook and unlock hundreds of unique recipes \u2014 from primitive weapons to complex survival tools. Combine, improvise, and experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>advanced crafting system</strong> gives you full creative control to adapt your strategy to changing conditions. Innovation is the only way to outlive the apocalypse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/21a368c48ae75824b80f2ab5f18c4c80.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/21a368c48ae75824b80f2ab5f18c4c80.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/21a368c48ae75824b80f2ab5f18c4c80.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your last safe haven.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and construct your base piece by piece. Fortify walls, lay traps, and prepare for the inevitable \u2014 the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each structure has real physics, durability, and vulnerabilities. Your base isn\u2019t just a home \u2014 it\u2019s your last line of defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/456f7db08731c1df9bb353a7369dc843.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/456f7db08731c1df9bb353a7369dc843.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/456f7db08731c1df9bb353a7369dc843.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every resource matters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry what you can, leave what you must. The more you build, the slower you move \u2014 and the world won\u2019t wait for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time, weight, and stamina create a brutal survival balance where efficiency can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ce4f86242794d34534c28bd708c8bd4e.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ce4f86242794d34534c28bd708c8bd4e.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/ce4f86242794d34534c28bd708c8bd4e.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Silence is your greatest weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your bow, steady your aim, and strike before they sense you. Long-range precision kills are key to staying undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>dynamic stealth system</strong> rewards patience and timing \u2014 one missed shot can turn silence into chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/090fba62285f83afad44b46c6a60ca01.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/090fba62285f83afad44b46c6a60ca01.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/090fba62285f83afad44b46c6a60ca01.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Close-range terror.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the last arrow flies and the enemy is still standing, you fight face-to-face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>intense first-person combat</strong> with advanced enemy AI and visceral animations that make every encounter personal and deadly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f247caf4001b8eaa3e98a71a393a27bd.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f247caf4001b8eaa3e98a71a393a27bd.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/f247caf4001b8eaa3e98a71a393a27bd.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Every kill tells a story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fallen corpse reminds you how close you came to death. Loot, scavenge, and learn from every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Way Back doesn\u2019t forgive \u2014 but it teaches. Adapt or perish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/30fead47affa08ea9825e873ae350a15.poster.avif?t=1759673117\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/30fead47affa08ea9825e873ae350a15.webm?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/extras/30fead47affa08ea9825e873ae350a15.mp4?t=1759673117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>When hope fades, fight harder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your shotgun, steady your hands, and take the final shot that decides your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic moments of desperation define the story of <strong>No Way Back: Dark Horizon</strong> \u2014 a survival experience where every decision, every bullet, every heartbeat matters.<strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Next-Gen AI System</strong> \u2013 Enemies react to noise, light, and scent for realistic survival encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf12 <strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 Visibility, temperature, and behavior change as the sun falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Deep Crafting &amp; Building</strong> \u2013 Build your shelter, craft weapons, and fortify defenses with physics-based systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Immersive First-Person Combat</strong> \u2013 From stealth takedowns to explosive boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfde\ufe0f <strong>Massive Open World</strong> \u2013 Explore, scavenge, and uncover the secrets buried beneath the Dark Horizon.</p></li></ul>","developers":["BlackMountainsStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976380/f67a4be2535ce75b1e17a9936552439c6c59df5e/header.jpg?t=1759673117","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976380/1779148129/436bc23154f17326099310d4a6aba1ee3fd7c167/1759672830/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759673115","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976380/1779148129/436bc23154f17326099310d4a6aba1ee3fd7c167/1759672830/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759673115","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976380/1779148129/436bc23154f17326099310d4a6aba1ee3fd7c167/1759672830/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759673115","id":257212567,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212567/movie480.mp4?t=1759673115","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212567/movie_max.mp4?t=1759673115"},"name":"Game play trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite